        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📷️ “MAHOROBA CAT”</strong> is a photo adventure game themed around <strong>“Tourism, Exploration, and Discovery!”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is tasked by their boss with taking photos for a travel magazine and sets off on a journey across Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From famous landmarks to hidden gems and everyday scenes, you’ll visit a wide variety of locations to create your own unique travel magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying in hotels, traveling by train and airplane—these quintessential travel experiences are also part of the game’s charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold up your camera and take the best shot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.poster.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.webm?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.mp4?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tourist attractions throughout Japan!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily visit tourist attractions throughout the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/49d8a82a820396f6fb81333628af1d37.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage inversion system allows you to explore every corner of the diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.poster.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.webm?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.mp4?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📷️ “MAHOROBA CAT”</strong> is a photo adventure game themed around <strong>“Tourism, Exploration, and Discovery!”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is tasked by their boss with taking photos for a travel magazine and sets off on a journey across Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From famous landmarks to hidden gems and everyday scenes, you’ll visit a wide variety of locations to create your own unique travel magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying in hotels, traveling by train and airplane—these quintessential travel experiences are also part of the game’s charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold up your camera and take the best shot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.poster.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.webm?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.mp4?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tourist attractions throughout Japan!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily visit tourist attractions throughout the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/49d8a82a820396f6fb81333628af1d37.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage inversion system allows you to explore every corner of the diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.poster.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.webm?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.mp4?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Travel across Japan with &quot;MAHOROBA CAT&quot;! The protagonist, tasked with taking photos for a travel magazine, visits famous landmarks nationwide to gather the desired shots. Now, set off on an adventure to capture your very own &quot;best shot&quot;!",
